// Signing, without anybody's team ending up in the repository.
//
// Building for a real device needs a development team, and a team ID is
// personal: committed, it leaks one and breaks the build for everyone else,
// who would be told to sign as somebody they are not.
//
// So put yours in ios/Local.xcconfig, which is not tracked:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Xcode shows it under Signing & Capabilities once it is there. The `?` means
// a checkout without one still opens, builds and runs in the simulator — only
// installing on a phone needs a team.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
